			<string>Camera Capture</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
		<string>Volume Up + Volume Down chord, and it acts the moment both are pressed: that starts or stops an audio recording, with no need to let go. While anything is recording the chord always means STOP, at any length. Keep holding past Hold Seconds (a haptic tick marks the moment) and video takes over: the audio recording is stopped and the video starts in its place, never both at once. Photo capture is no longer triggered by any gesture in this build. Capture is silent and files save next to the audio recordings. Use Microphone Channel decides whether video carries an audio track (off = silent footage). The iOS privacy dot is controlled by Hide Privacy Dot under Privacy Indicator. Video formats mirror the Camera app and unsupported combinations fall back automatically.</string>
